 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? That's a lovely number. Pick one venue that can hold everyone, even if it's bit small. Nice and relaxed. Do you want full kitchen, or buffet style? Not necessarily. A chef can handle a lot with good support. You could do one or two dishes yourself as a treat. Nice. Make sure there's plenty of room at tables for everyone to talk. Small talk is the glue that holds family together. Some people like dorms, others book a separate building. Do you want to decide on one now, or keep the option open?",
